#
# tests/insn/aarch64.symmetric
# ============================
#
# Operand pairs whose exchange cannot change the result, so the "operands
# exchanged" control of tests/insn/check.sh would be accepted by any
# correct model; the check skips them and prints the reason.
#
#     ENTRY  PAIR  reason

sha512su1  ac  the first and third operands enter the result only through their sum
add_4u32   ab  addition is commutative
add_2u64   ab  addition is commutative
